#. macro: <if ($gn75 == 7)>(TV mode)</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 75 == 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:4019:0:0"
msgid "Limit frame rate to 30 fps <if ($gn75 == 7)>(TV mode)</if>."
msgstr "Ограничить частоту кадров до 30 кадр/с<if ($gn75 == 7)> (режим ТВ)</if>."

