#. ja: 任務期限 : <num $n1>時間<num $n2>分後<set-time $n3>[<num $month>/<num $day> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>]
#. de: Zeit für die Erfüllung: <if ($n1 == 0)><if ($n2 == 1)>1 Minute<else><num $n2> Minuten</if><else><num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>Stunde<else>Stunden</if><if ($n2 == 0)><else> <if ($n2 == 1)>1 Minute<else><num $n2> Minuten</if></if></if> <set-time $n3>[<num $day>.<num $month>. <num $hour>:<num2 $min>]
#. fr: Temps restant<nbsp>: <num $n1> <if ($n1 <= 1)>heure<else>heures</if> <num $n2> <if ($n2 <= 1)>minute<else>minutes</if> <set-time $n3>[<num $day>.<num $month>  <num $hour>h<num2 $min>]
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>hour<else>hours</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)>minute<else>minutes</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <set-time $n3> — sets the time placeholders ($hour, $day, …) to a Unix time; time = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num2 $min> — a number with at least two digits, such as 05; value = minutes of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $day> — a number; value = day of the month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:4581:0:0"
msgid "Next Mission Allowance in <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>hour<else>hours</if> and <num $n2> <if ($n2 == 1)>minute<else>minutes</if> at <set-time $n3><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> on <num $month>/<num $day> (Earth time)."
msgstr "Следующее снабжение через <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>ч<else>ч</if> и <num $n2> <if ($n2 == 1)>мин<else>мин</if>, <set-time $n3><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>вечера<else>утра</if>, <num $day>.<num $month> (земное время)."

